odiversity of Andean flora and fauna with our expert guide.', NULL, 'Recorre una de las ciudadelas antiguas del imperio inca y vive una emocionante aventura ', 'Explore one of the ancient citadels of the Inca empire and experience an exciting adventure', 'MACHUPICCHU', 'MACHU PICCHU', NULL, NULL, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '480.00', '50', '0', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 'persona', '', '', '1776093032_principal.jpg', 'activo', '1', '2026-04-13 10:10:32', '0', 'USD', '0', '0', '1', '', '', 'Moderado', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', '', NULL, NULL);
