e rich biodiversity of Andean flora and fauna with our expert guide.', NULL, 'Vive la experiencia de recorrer la caminata hasta uno de los nevados famosos de la región', 'Experience the hike to one of the region\'s famous snow-capped mountains', 'TOURS A SALKANTAY', 'TOURS TO SALKANTAY', NULL, NULL, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '620.00', '50', '0', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 'persona', '', '', '1776100343_principal.jpg', 'activo', '1', '2026-04-13 12:10:23', '0', 'USD', '0', '0', '2', '', '', 'Moderado', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', '', NULL, NULL);
